tests/graded/_m_o_r_t_extra_test.py is derived from the first by recompiling its
fixtures with the reference fontTools.

Two fixtures in those modules come from the Unicode text-rendering-tests fonts
TestAATMorx.ttf and TestMORXFourtyone.ttf (unicode-org/text-rendering-tests at
26cfb96d094befc3c8b08228577bf400b04b83a1, also vendored by HarfBuzz under
test/shape/data/text-rendering-tests/ at f6b7a4cb7216b900229f0a11110784d5ff9cf796).
fontTools converted them to classic mort tables; this task re-encodes them under
shifted glyph orders. Their notices follow the fontTools licence.

